LOCATION:Vermilionville\, 300 Fisher Rd\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:Bayou Vermilion District & Vermilionville host the Bal du Diman
 che (Sunday Dance) EVERY WEEK (may be pre-empted by private events). This 
 live music series is held in Vermilionville’s Performance Center and rus
 tic dancehall from 1-4 p.m. Admission is $12 and includes a self-guided to
 ur of the Vermilionville Living History Museum.\nCome early and grab lunch
  at Vermilionville’s restaurant\, La Cuisine de Maman. The restaurant is
  open every Sunday from 11 a.m.-2 p.m. and features authentic Cajun and Cr
 eole cuisine. On Sundays\, the restaurant features an all-you-can-eat Sund
 ay buffet. Le Bal du Dimanche is broadcast live on KRVS Public Media 1-3 P
